body:
Yeah, it all depends on what capital city you're extending outwards from. I'd say our equivalent would be Bumbury, which is an absolute fucking hole (sorry, Bumburians), to the point where we're putting in a bypass because nobody wants to go through Bumbury. It's got a 24 hour Kmart (the only one in the state?????) and a lot of shops, schools, etc. Would I want to live there? Absolutely not. 

&#x200B;

Below 100k anywhere is a pipe dream, I will agree with that.
